\newlabel{fig:distributions}{{5}{23}{Distributions of the five key fault-bearing PIDs across all 129 files. Fuel trims are roughly symmetric and slightly rich-shifted with visible OBD-II quantization; coolant is bimodal (cold-start shoulder plus a warm-operation peak near 88--90$^{\circ }$C); MAP is multimodal from the idle/driving mixture; timing sits entirely inside its physical envelope}{figure.caption.9}{}}
