\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Bivariate structure, colored by a row-level regime proxy. Left: MAP vs RPM separates the idle cluster from the driving cloud --- the region the air-system fault perturbs. Center: RPM vs speed resolves into discrete gear bands, a drivetrain sanity check that a residual column shift would scramble. Right: timing advance climbs and stabilizes as coolant warms --- the coupling the coolant-sensor fault exploits.}}{25}{figure.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:bivariate}{{7}{25}{Bivariate structure, colored by a row-level regime proxy. Left: MAP vs RPM separates the idle cluster from the driving cloud --- the region the air-system fault perturbs. Center: RPM vs speed resolves into discrete gear bands, a drivetrain sanity check that a residual column shift would scramble. Right: timing advance climbs and stabilizes as coolant warms --- the coupling the coolant-sensor fault exploits}{figure.caption.11}{}}
